00:08:25.490 --> 00:08:37.690
Cumulative P&amp;L stands at $299.63. The matched window alpha versus NASDAQ stands at negative 4.8% across nine rules-based trades.

00:08:38.350 --> 00:08:48.790
Average return per trade is 0.50%. Best trade reached 20.11% and worst trade reached negative 11.80%.

00:08:48.790 --> 00:09:02.930
Current streak is 1 loss. This record began August 18, 2026 under the published rules. Before we wrap, open your brokerage platform, pull up LMT and check the 30-day at the money covered call premium.

